  "text": "This look combines a relaxed yet polished silhouette for your morning yoga, transitioning smoothly into your coffee date. The olive knit sweater offers soft comfort for movement, while the blue kerchief adds a vibrant pop of color that catches the daylight. Worn with comfortable beige linen trousers and natural taupé loafers, the ensemble balances ease with enough structure to feel put-together at the café.",
  "how_to_wear": [
    "Tuck the olive sweater slightly into the waistband of your beige trousers to emphasize your defined waistline, creating a clean horizontal line that elongates your legs.",
    "Drape the blue kerchief over one shoulder for an asymmetric look that adds casual flair while you stretch during yoga or walk across the city."
  ],
