      "n": "#164·32",
      "text": "A classic olive green sweater made from a soft cotton and viscose blend, featuring a simple crew neck and ribbed cuffs that hug the wrists for a tidy finish."
    },
    {
      "n": "#445·27",
      "text": "A bright royal blue kerchief crafted from fine merino wool, designed to be draped loosely or worn as an asymmetric top layer for instant visual interest."
    },
